sequenceDiagram
    %% Источник: шаги UC-1 из use-cases.md
    actor P1 as P-1 Специалист
    participant API as API /extract
    participant PP as Stage 0 Preprocess
    participant EX as Rules + CatalogModel
    participant VF as Verifier
    participant LLM as LLM-шлюз
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    P1->>API: POST /extract (title, description)
    API->>PP: очистка HTML, truncate, leakage
    PP-->>API: clean text
    API->>EX: извлечь атрибуты
    EX-->>API: value + confidence + source_span
    API->>VF: проверить value_set / unit / source_span
    VF-->>API: accepted | review
    API->>LLM: opt-in, только gaps
    LLM-->>API: значения хвоста
    API->>DB: сохранить результат
    API-->>P1: JSON (value, confidence, status)
